    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CS Manager is a passion project over two years in the making, and its finally here! Choose your team and take them to  the top of the circuit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between more than 140 teams</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the most elite pros to the unorganized amateur leagues, choose your team and take them all the way to the top. Or create your own organization and work your way up from the very bottom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your squad</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure skill is not everything when signing players. To create the perfect team dynamic you must take roles, personalities, and languages into consideration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/4c3472d1e7d40c01e12519ccf108d7bd.poster.avif?t=1744466214\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/4c3472d1e7d40c01e12519ccf108d7bd.webm?t=1744466214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/4c3472d1e7d40c01e12519ccf108d7bd.mp4?t=1744466214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-depth match engine options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your tactics unfold in a new advanced match engine, that will test your game sense and read of your opponents. Choose between a full match simulation where your timeouts and instructions are played out in real time, a faster simulation with a score overview, or an instant simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/d676a90e676211e3290a535568c2c31c.poster.avif?t=1744466214\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/d676a90e676211e3290a535568c2c31c.webm?t=1744466214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/d676a90e676211e3290a535568c2c31c.mp4?t=1744466214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage dynamic personalities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and priorities when dealing with conflicts and disputes on the team will be key to your success</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/2bb94c93d510852283090d3ebb0bd62f.poster.avif?t=1744466214\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/2bb94c93d510852283090d3ebb0bd62f.webm?t=1744466214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/2bb94c93d510852283090d3ebb0bd62f.mp4?t=1744466214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist CS Manager now, and stay tuned for more updates and release in 2025! You can also check out our Discord</strong></p>",
